| Name | Default | Read at | Effect |
|---|---|---|---|
| `get_variables_dictionary(input_root = ".")` | `"."` | `:88-89` | Root used for `variables_dictionary.csv` on the *first* call |
| `get_binary_variables_ids_map(input_root = ".")` | `"."` | `:151-152` | Root used for `investment_dictionary.csv` on the *first* call |
| `get_plugin(world = nullptr)` | `nullptr` | `:80` | MPI communicator forwarded to the `Plugin` on first construction |
| Plugin data dir | `./plugin_inputs/inputs_micro_it` (hard-coded) | `:82` | Pre-computed grid data loaded by `Plugin` |
